## What to deliver

Build the soldier sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: a heavy, mandibled ant drawn in neutral
grey, animated as a four-step walk cycle in each of its four facings — down (0–3),
up (4–7), left (8–11), right (12–15) — its legs alternating and body bobbing so
each facing plays as a walk. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame
action logs are your finished submission.
